{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16472","headline":"送庐州贾使君拜命 · 刘商","name":"送庐州贾使君拜命","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"考绩朝称贵，时清武用文。\n二天移外府，三命佐元勳。\n佩玉兼高位，摐金阅上军。\n威容冠是铁，图画阁名芸。\n人咏甘棠茂，童谣竹马羣。\n悬旌风肃肃，卧辙泪纷纷。\n特达恩难报，升沈路易分。\n侯嬴不得从，心逐信陵君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16472.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16472","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}